---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Zhang Rental Management SMS Terms and Conditions"
  description="Terms and conditions for Zhang Rental Management property operations SMS support."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 3rem; max-width: 820px;">
    <span class="eyebrow">SMS Terms</span>
    <h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      These terms cover non-marketing, automated property operations SMS
      support sent by <strong>Zhang Rental Management</strong> to existing
      residential tenants and service vendors who opt in through the published
      SMS consent flow.
    </p>

    <h2>Program Description</h2>
    <p>
      Property operations SMS support is used for transactional messages about
      maintenance acknowledgements, repair
      follow-up, appointment coordination, service requests, lease or parking
      support, and vendor scheduling. The program does not send marketing or
      promotional messages.
    </p>

    <h2>Consent</h2>
    <p>
      An existing tenant or service vendor opts in by reviewing the public
      <a href="/property-sms/">SMS consent notice</a> and personally texting
      <strong>START</strong> to <strong>+1 (630) 407-1314</strong>. START is the
      only opt-in method for this program. By texting START, the person agrees
      to receive recurring
      transactional property operations messages. Consent is not a condition of
      renting or receiving property management services.
    </p>

    <h2>Message Frequency</h2>
    <p>
      Message frequency varies based on the user's service request, maintenance
      issue, appointment coordination need, lease or parking question, or
      vendor scheduling interaction.
    </p>

    <h2>Message and Data Rates</h2>
    <p>
      Message and data rates may apply according to the user's mobile carrier
      plan. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.
    </p>

    <h2>Help and Opt Out</h2>
    <p>
      Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for assistance. Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to
      stop receiving SMS messages. After opting out, users may reply
      <strong>START</strong> to resubscribe.
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      The privacy policy for this SMS program is available at
      <a href="/privacy/">https://sciencesloop.com/privacy/</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For SMS support or questions about these terms, contact
      <a href="mailto:luzhang@sciencesloop.com">luzhang@sciencesloop.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
